== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @ground beef{3/10%lb}, @gluten-free corn tortillas{12/5}, @butter{3/5%tbsp}, @garlic cloves{4/5} (minced), @gluten-free BBQ sauce{1/10%cup}, @honey{3/5%tbsp}, @smoked paprika{1/5%tsp}, @chili powder (gluten-free){1/5%tsp}, @cheddar{1/5%cup} (shredded), @mayo (gluten-free){1/20%cup}, @lime juice{1/5%tbsp}, @cilantro{1/20%cup} (chopped), @green onions{3/5} (sliced), @Salt + pepper{} (to taste).

== Preparation ==

Brown the beef and cook the garlic in butter. Stir in barbecue sauce, honey and spices. Warm the corn tortillas, fill with beef and cheddar, and finish with lime mayonnaise, cilantro and green onion.
